2 CONT * Reinhold Wilhelm von Aderkas (1729 - 1814)
2 CONT
2 CONT Reinhold Wilhelm von Aderkas
2 CONT Born 31 May 1729 in Tackfer, Poenal, Wiek, Estlandmap
2 CONT ANCESTORS ancestors
2 CONT Son of Georg Gustav von Aderkas and Helena Christina von Rohr
2 CONT Brother of Gerdruta Elisabeth von Aderkas [half]
2 CONT Husband of Anna Luise von Pistohlkors — married 29 Mar 1760 [location unknown]
2 CONT [children unknown]
2 CONT Died 5 Jun 1814 at age 85 in Tackfer, Poenal, Wiek, Estlandmap
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT a. Sallajöggi & Tackfer. Second-Major in the Russian service.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT Astaf von Transehe-Roseneck. Genealogisches Handbuch der baltischen Ritterschaft, Teil Livland, Band I. Görlitz: Verlag für Sippenforschung und Wappenkunde, 1929. 412.
