1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Freiherr Nikolaus Wilhelm von Korff, Herr auf Galinden, Jaskendorff und Nuskern''' ''(AKA: Nicolaus Wilhelm, Wilhelm Nicolaus)''
2 CONT was born on June 14, 1720. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-65819908 Friedrich Heinrich Bar. Korff, Erbherr zu Bledau, Nuskern,Kossulen, Kowalen, Jaskendorff,Kunter] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34644473034 Baro
2 CONC nin Sophie Louise Köhne von Jasky]. He was a 1765-1772 starost von tolkemit. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Nikolaus married [https://www.geni.com/profile-65817592 Elisabeth Jeffrages (Jeffreys)]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34714069765 Freiherr Carl Friedrich Wilhelm von Korff] (*1759 - †1779);
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34714068838 Sophie Amalie von Korff] (*1761 - );
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34714069816 Freifrau Wilhelmine Amalie Freiin von Korff] (*1764 - †1820);
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34660003388 Karoline Elisabeth Beate Baronin von Korff] (*1770 - †1846);
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34666651556 Gräfin Henriette Katharina Freiin von Korff, Erbfrau auf Jäskendorf] (*1771 - †1807). 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1776. 
2 CONT ''(Biography generated on 21 Mar 2024)''
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Vabahärra; Galindeni, Winkenhageni, Skerpeni, Saurkeni jt, mõisate omanik Preisi - ning Kuramaal, Tolkemitti staarost.
