1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Cedersparre_nr_1511#TAB_6 '''Carolina Charlotta Cedersparre'''], född 1767-03-28, död som ung.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Clarification:''' In Adelsvapen (vs. SSHY) there are two siblings with the same name '''Carolina Charlotta''': 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Some academic''' has whined: "Charlotta Carolina, född 1761-07-31. I Pälkäne socken, död i Pälkäne 1765-04-19. Gift 1802-09-12 i Suoniemi kap. Med sergeanten Carl Johan Roupé ('''''ej död ung''''')."  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''In the ancient''' county of Latinia, (Rome socken, Latin fs. italien) they had this proverb, which goes as follows: "''Si tacuisses, philosophus mansisses''". Please do contemplate on that prior to posting nonsense. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''It is always''' advisable to check out the facts first before unleashing the feelings on autopilot.   
