1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Heinrich Georg Edward Frhr. von Ungern-Sternberg''' was born on October 9, 1782 in Vana-Kuuste, Vana-Kuuste, Tartu County, Estonia. His parents were Otto Reinhold Ludwig von Ungern-Sternberg and  Magdalena Charlotte von der Pah
2 CONC len. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Heinrich Georg Edward married Maria Stella Petronella Chiappini on September 11, 1810 in Cheltenham (England). They had one child Edward (Ned) James Archibald Percival Frhr. von Ungern-Sternberg 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on August 17, 1861 in Kõrgessaare, Kõrgessaare, Hiiumaa, Estonia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT * https://et.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heinrich_Georg_Eduard_von_Ungern-Sternberg
2 CONT * http://www.ra.ee/dgs/_purl.php?shc=EAA.1423.1.244:2?68,78,1287,1869,0
2 CONT * https://www.eha.ee/fondiloend/frames/fond_prop.php?id=2847
2 CONT * https://www.eha.ee/fondiloend/frames/fond_prop.php?id=3063
2 CONT * https://dea.digar.ee/article/hiiuleht/2015/02/10/9.1
2 CONT * https://personen.digitale-sammlungen.de/baltlex/Blatt_bsb00000600,00474.html?prozent=
2 CONT * http://www.thepeerage.com/p8498.htm#i84973
2 CONT
2 CONT Heinrich von Unger-Sternberg oli koos vennaga asutanud 1829. aastal Hiiumaal kalevivabriku. Nõvale asus elama tema poeg Eduard Archibald Percival (Ned) (17.august 1811 Kõrgessaare - 6.jaanuar 1842. Tallinn) koos abikaasa Anna Hele
2 CONC na (sündinud von Helffreich, Purula mõisast)
