2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Von_Rosen-57
2 CONT
2 CONT BARON WOLDEMAR REINHOLD VON ROSEN a. Piera was * 18.ix, Kardina, and bap. 3.x.1815, Ksp. St. Johannis Jerwen[1]. He + 27 and was bu. 31.vii.1889, St. Olai, Reval[2]. He served in the Russian military, retiring young with the rank 
2 CONC of lieutenant at some point before 1844[3]. He was a Manngerichts Assessor, district head of the Estland Gubernial Excise Administration, and owned Gut Piera, Ksp. Wesenberg[4].
2 CONT
2 CONT He oo 19.x.1843, Ksp. Wesenberg, to MARIE ZOEGE VON MANTEUFFEL, daughter of Heinrich Otto Zoege von Manteuffel and Gräfin Anna Christina von Dücker[5]. She was * 24.ii.1823, Kurküll, St. Jakobi, Wierland[6]. She + 8 and was bu. 11
2 CONC .v.1900, St. Olai, Reval[7].
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ...ämbetsman inom skatte- och uppbördsväsendet; löjtnant; rysk baron genom senatsukas 17 10 1855; ägde Piera...  Nyintroducerade svenska adelsätter, utgivna av Riddarhusdirektionen, Stockholm 1992, s. 59
2 CONT
