2 CONT Alternative Birth date 15.03.1819
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Tema kohta kogu see jutt; Johann Friedrich Alexander von Stackelberg, 1819 - 1890<br/>
2 CONT Johann Friedrich Alexander von Stackelberg was born on '''March 15 1819''', in Reval,<br/>
2 CONT * to ''Peter Alexander Gottfried von Stackelberg'' and '''Ottilie Helene Beata von Stackelberg''' (born von '''Mohrenschildt''').
2 CONT * Peter was born on '''March 23 1784''', in Kassar (Kasari), Käina vald, Dagö (Hiiumaa), Estland.
2 CONT * Ottilie was born on '''October 10 1793'''. Johann had 3 siblings:
2 CONT * Jakob Friedrich von Stackelberg, 
2 CONT * Katharina (Kitty) Ottilie von Stackelberg and 
2 CONT * Barbara Elisabeth von Stackelberg. Johann passed away on '''June 12 1890''', at age 71 in Reval.<br/>
2 CONT <br/>Johann Friedrich Alexander von Stackelberg, 1819 – 1890: Johann Friedrich Alexander von Stackelberg sündis 15. märtsil 1819 Tallinnas (Reval) Peter Alexander Gottfried von Stackelbergi ja Ottilie Helene Beata von Stackelbergi
2 CONC  (neiuna von Mohrenschildt) perre. Isa Peter sündis 23. märtsil 1784 Kassaris (Kasari), Käina vald, Hiiumaa (Dagö), Eestimaa (Estland). Ema Ottilie sündis 10. oktoobril 1793. Johannil oli 3 õve: Jakob Friedrich von Stackelberg, Ka
2 CONC tharina (Kitty) Ottilie von Stackelberg ja Barbara Elisabeth von Stackelberg. Johann suri 12. juunil 1890 Tallinnas (Reval) olles 71-aastane.
1 NOTE {geni:hair_color} Black
